{
  "slug": "lesson-skill-loop",
  "name": "Lesson Skill Loop",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Turn development lessons into reusable skills — analyze tag patterns, propose skill creation, sync improvements, check health, and map traceability",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **3 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `lesson` (Record development lessons with tags), `skill-loop` (Analyze development lessons and propose skill candidates)\n- **Commands** (3): `skill-loop-health` (Check health of existing skills against lesson patterns), `skill-loop-sync` (Detect gaps between lessons and existing skills), `skill-loop` (Analyze development lessons and suggest skill candidates)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install lesson-skill-loop@claude-community` from `aliksir/lesson-skill-loop`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
